23
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,160
Like when are we both open?

24
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:51,040
And it's just horrible, complicated issue.

25
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:56,560
And Fantastical has become like the lifeline of driving me through the day.

26
00:01:56,800 --> 00:02:02,960
And so I think this time has been a good it's been a good wait in terms of me being excited about this, at least.

27
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,240
That's great to hear.

28
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:04,640
Cool.

